  <!-- EN: Archite xenotypes -->
  <XTS_FilterArchite>遠古分子異種人</XTS_FilterArchite>
  <!-- EN: Preset xenotypes containing archite genes (e.g., Sanguophage). Scenario xenotypes are grouped under the scenario row instead. -->
  <XTS_FilterArchiteDesc>含有遠古分子基因的預設異種人（例如噬血者）。腳本異種人改為歸類在腳本列中。</XTS_FilterArchiteDesc>
  <!-- EN: Germline xenotypes -->
  <XTS_FilterInheritable>種系異種人</XTS_FilterInheritable>
  <!-- EN: Preset xenotypes whose xenogerm rewrites the pawn's germline: inheritable xenotypes (e.g., Impid, Yttakin) and Baseliner, whose empty xenogerm converts the pawn back to a baseliner. -->
  <XTS_FilterInheritableDesc>其異種細胞會改寫此人種系基因的預設異種人：可遺傳異種人（例如魔人、依達人），以及一般人類（其空異種細胞會讓此人轉換回一般人類）。</XTS_FilterInheritableDesc>
