  <!-- EN: Xenogerm pricing -->
  <XTS_PricingSection>異種細胞定價</XTS_PricingSection>
  <!-- EN: Market value formula for trader-sold xenogerms. Affects new xenogerms only. -->
  <XTS_PricingSectionDesc>商人販售異種細胞的市場價值公式。僅影響新產生的異種細胞。</XTS_PricingSectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Base preset value: {0} -->
  <XTS_BasePresetValue>基礎預設價值：{0}</XTS_BasePresetValue>
  <!-- EN: Base silver value added to all preset xenotype xenogerms -->
  <XTS_BasePresetValueDesc>所有預設異種人異種細胞額外增加的基礎白銀價值</XTS_BasePresetValueDesc>
  <!-- EN: Value per metabolism: {0} -->
  <XTS_ValuePerMetabolism>每點代謝效率價值：{0}</XTS_ValuePerMetabolism>
  <!-- EN: Silver value added per point of absolute metabolism -->
  <XTS_ValuePerMetabolismDesc>每點絕對代謝效率增加的白銀價值</XTS_ValuePerMetabolismDesc>
  <!-- EN: Value per complexity: {0} -->
  <XTS_ValuePerComplexity>每點複雜度價值：{0}</XTS_ValuePerComplexity>
  <!-- EN: Silver value added per point of genetic complexity -->
  <XTS_ValuePerComplexityDesc>每點基因複雜度增加的白銀價值</XTS_ValuePerComplexityDesc>
  <!-- EN: Value per archite gene: {0} -->
  <XTS_ValuePerArchite>每個遠古分子基因價值：{0}</XTS_ValuePerArchite>
  <!-- EN: Silver value added per archite gene -->
  <XTS_ValuePerArchiteDesc>每個遠古分子基因增加的白銀價值</XTS_ValuePerArchiteDesc>

  <!-- EN: Stock quantity -->
  <XTS_QuantitySection>庫存數量</XTS_QuantitySection>
  <!-- EN: How many xenogerms each trader kind carries, rolled from its range on every visit. Affects new traders only. -->
  <XTS_QuantitySectionDesc>每種商人每次到訪時，會從其數量範圍中抽選攜帶的異種細胞數量。僅影響新出現的商人。</XTS_QuantitySectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: {0}: {1}~{2} -->
  <XTS_TraderCount>{0}：{1}~{2}</XTS_TraderCount>
  <!-- EN: {0} (orbital) -->
  <XTS_TraderOrbital>{0}（軌道）</XTS_TraderOrbital>
  <!-- EN: {0} (caravan) -->
  <XTS_TraderCaravan>{0}（旅隊）</XTS_TraderCaravan>
  <!-- EN: Xenogerms this trader arrives with, rolled from this range each visit -->
  <XTS_TraderCountDesc>此商人到訪時攜帶的異種細胞數量，每次從此範圍中抽選</XTS_TraderCountDesc>

  <!-- EN: Implantation -->
  <XTS_ImplantationSection>植入</XTS_ImplantationSection>
  <!-- EN: How trader-sold xenogerms behave when implanted. -->
  <XTS_ImplantationSectionDesc>商人販售的異種細胞植入後的行為方式。</XTS_ImplantationSectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Implant germline xenotypes as endogenes -->
  <XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenes>將種系異種人植入為種系基因</XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenes>
  <!-- EN: Preserve deathrest capacity through implantation -->
  <XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacity>植入時保留絕息容量</XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacity>
  <!-- EN: Vanilla recreates the deathrest gene on every xenogerm implant or sanguophage reimplant, resetting serum-bought deathrest capacity to one. With this on, the pawn's previous capacity is restored whenever it still has a deathrest gene afterwards. Applies to all xenogerms, not just trader-sold ones. -->
  <XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacityDesc>原版遊戲在每次異種細胞植入或噬血者移植基因時，都會重新產生絕息基因，並將以血清購得的絕息容量重設為一。啟用此選項後，只要此人植入後仍擁有絕息基因，便會恢復其先前的絕息容量。此選項適用於所有異種細胞，不僅限於商人販售的異種細胞。</XTS_PreserveDeathrestCapacityDesc>
  <!-- EN: When a trader-sold xenogerm for a germline xenotype is implanted, its genes replace the pawn's endogenes instead of becoming xenogenes, making the pawn a born member of that xenotype: children inherit the genes, and later xenogerm implants add to them instead of overwriting them. Xenogenes the pawn already carries are kept, and a pawn named for them (a sanguophage, say) keeps its name and icon. -->
  <XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenesDesc>植入商人販售的種系異種人異種細胞時，其基因會取代此人的種系基因，而非成為異種基因，使此人成為該異種人的天生成員：後代將可遺傳這些基因，之後植入的異種細胞也會疊加而非覆蓋它們。此人原有的異種基因會被保留，若此人因這些基因而被命名（例如噬血者），則會保留其名稱與圖示。</XTS_ImplantGermlineAsEndogenesDesc>

  <!-- EN: Xenotype commonality by price -->
  <XTS_CommonalitySection>依價格決定的異種人常見度</XTS_CommonalitySection>
  <!-- EN: How a trader picks which xenotypes to stock, weighted by the prices of everything currently sellable. Affects new stock only. -->
  <XTS_CommonalitySectionDesc>商人如何依目前所有可販售異種人的價格加權，選擇要進貨的異種人。僅影響新產生的庫存。</XTS_CommonalitySectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Inverse -->
  <XTS_StrategyInversePrice>反比</XTS_StrategyInversePrice>
  <!-- EN: Cheaper xenogerms are more common: chance is proportional to 1 / price. Archite xenogerms stay rare. -->
  <XTS_StrategyInversePriceDesc>較便宜的異種細胞較常見：機率與 1 / 價格 成正比。遠古分子異種細胞依然稀少。</XTS_StrategyInversePriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Inverse root -->
  <XTS_StrategySoftInversePrice>反平方根</XTS_StrategySoftInversePrice>
  <!-- EN: Cheaper xenogerms are more common, with a gentler bias: chance is proportional to 1 / √price. -->
  <XTS_StrategySoftInversePriceDesc>較便宜的異種細胞較常見，但傾向較為和緩：機率與 1 / √價格 成正比。</XTS_StrategySoftInversePriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Linear -->
  <XTS_StrategyPrice>線性</XTS_StrategyPrice>
  <!-- EN: Pricier xenogerms are more common: chance is proportional to price. -->
  <XTS_StrategyPriceDesc>較昂貴的異種細胞較常見：機率與價格成正比。</XTS_StrategyPriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Square root -->
  <XTS_StrategySqrtPrice>平方根</XTS_StrategySqrtPrice>
  <!-- EN: Pricier xenogerms are more common, with a gentler bias: chance is proportional to √price. -->
  <XTS_StrategySqrtPriceDesc>較昂貴的異種細胞較常見，但傾向較為和緩：機率與 √價格 成正比。</XTS_StrategySqrtPriceDesc>
  <!-- EN: Bell curve -->
  <XTS_StrategyBellCurve>鐘形曲線</XTS_StrategyBellCurve>
  <!-- EN: Mid-priced xenogerms are most common: chances follow a bell curve centred on the median price, so the cheapest and priciest are both rare. -->
  <XTS_StrategyBellCurveDesc>中價位的異種細胞最為常見：機率遵循以價格中位數為中心的鐘形曲線分佈，因此最便宜與最昂貴的都較為稀少。</XTS_StrategyBellCurveDesc>
  <!-- EN: Uniform -->
  <XTS_StrategyUniform>均等</XTS_StrategyUniform>
  <!-- EN: Every sellable xenotype is equally likely, regardless of price. -->
  <XTS_StrategyUniformDesc>無論價格為何，每個可販售異種人的機率均等。</XTS_StrategyUniformDesc>

  <!-- EN:  (default) -->
  <XTS_DefaultSuffix> (預設)</XTS_DefaultSuffix>
  <!-- EN: Reset to defaults -->
  <XTS_ResetToDefaults>恢復為預設值</XTS_ResetToDefaults>

</LanguageData>
